  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요 ^^</p><p>서울,경기지역 과학교사 모임인 '신나는 과학을 만드는 사람들(이하 신과람)'에서 처음으로&nbsp;직무연수를 진행합니다.&nbsp;</p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">연수 기간&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">:&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>2016</b></font></span><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">년&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">1</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">월&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">25</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">)~29</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">금</span></b></font><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>) 09:00~15:50</b></font>, 5</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">일간</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">총&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">30</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">시간</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><div style=\"font: 12px/16.8px 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; widows: 1; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">연수 장소 및 인원&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">서울교육대학교 연구강의동&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">5</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">층</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">총&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">48</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">중등</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">고등 각&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">24</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">3. 대상 : 전국 중, 고교&nbsp;과학교사</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">연수 참가비&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">: 98,000</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.53px; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.33px;\">5. 신청 방법 및 기간&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#2508ee\">1)&nbsp;</font></span><font color=\"#2508ee\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">신청 기간&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">: 2015.12. 7.(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">) ~ 11</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">금</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></font></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">신청 방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 17.5pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">온라인 주소</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"http://goo.gl/forms/r5wj7PvX4L\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#0066cc\">http://goo.gl/forms/r5wj7PvX4L</font></span></a><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.53px; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.33px;\">&nbsp; * 연수 신청시 중등 또는 고등 프로그램 선택가능합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.53px; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 13.33px;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 10pt;\"><p>6. 강좌 세부진행표 </p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/235E2233565AD23F1D\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"700\" width=\"700\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"시간표.jpg\"  id=\"A_235E2233565AD23F1DBB45\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 102, 255);\">관심있으신 분들은 아래 링크(신과람 홈페이지 연수안내 글)를 클릭하시어 자세한 내용을 살펴보시길 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 102, 255);\">(궁금하신 점도 아래 링크를 클릭하신 후 신과람&nbsp;카페에</span><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 102, 255);\">&nbsp;댓글을 달아주심 됩니다. ^^)</span></strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p></span></div></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://cafe.naver.com/tes1993/1426\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 102, 255);\">http://cafe.naver.com/tes1993/1426</span></strong></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
